error[keywords]: `uint32` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:8
   │
 2 │ module uint32 {  // 'uint32' is a primitive type keyword
   ·        ^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 3 │     struct Point {
 4 │         long x;
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_uint32`
